    "title": "商品条码添加",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\" tabindex=\"-1\">功能简介<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>添加商品条码时，智慧记AI进销存提供了以下方式：</p>\n<p>•  新增/修改单个商品时，扫码填充、手动输入或自动生成商品条码</p>\n<p>•  批量导入新增商品时导入商品条码</p>\n<p>•  批量生成商品条形码</p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">业务场景<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>扫码入库或者销售时，需要用到商品条码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" tabindex=\"-1\">操作流程<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%AA%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E7%A0%81\" tabindex=\"-1\">添加单个商品条码<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%AA%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E7%A0%81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><strong>路径：</strong>【商品】-【商品】- 新增/修改商品，支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>扫码自动识别条形码</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>手动输入条形码</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>点击自动生成条形码</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/180a0330f3975edd2c7b8cafb2a1a146.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E7%A0%81\" tabindex=\"-1\">导入新增商品时导入商品条码<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%97%B6%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E7%A0%81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>路径：【商品】-【商品】-【导入新增】\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/75046d2f14314d40c9197531e3eea71d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>在表格内填写要导入新增的商品信息和条形码\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/c1aa6ef92226eb7f4bbc2044358189c9.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E5%BD%A2%E7%A0%81\" tabindex=\"-1\">批量生成商品条形码<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%9D%A1%E5%BD%A2%E7%A0%81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>路径：【商品】-【商品】-【批量操作】，勾选或筛选商品后，点击【生成条形码】</p>\n<p>更多详情点此查看<a href=\"https://www.zhihuiji.cn/help/doc/909\">批量操作生成商品条码</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/f65a987a98d1a4f38b2291641c889122.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
